const WILL = [['Write down your debts, and debts owed to you', 'Loans, unpaid zakat, promises, things borrowed. These are paid before anything else.'], ['Choose two trusted executors', 'They carry out your will. Ideally someone who knows Islamic inheritance and someone organised.'], ['Name guardians for your children', 'Who would raise them if both parents died? Ask them first.'], ['Decide your wasiyyah: up to a third', 'For charity, sadaqah jariyah, or people who don’t inherit (a step-child, a carer, a friend). Not to your heirs.'], ['Leave the rest to the fixed shares', 'Use the Inheritance tool to see who gets what. A solicitor writes it into the will by name.'], ['Write your funeral wishes', 'A Muslim burial, quickly, simple, which masjid, no extravagance.'], ['Make it legal in England', 'In writing, signed in front of two witnesses who are not beneficiaries or married to one. A will that just says “follow Sharia” can fail.'], ['Tell your family where it is', 'And who your executors are.'], ['Review it after big changes', 'Marriage cancels an existing will in England, so write a new one. Also after divorce, children or a move.']];
